🔥 Common Interview Traps

❌ Using multiple if statements instead of elif for mutually exclusive conditions.

❌ Forgetting to initialize variables before using them.

❌ Writing deeply nested if statements when simpler logic is possible.

❌ Confusing elif with a new if.

Remember:

if → starts the decision chain

elif → continues the same decision chain

else → handles everything else

❌ Incorrect indentation.

Python uses indentation to define program structure.

